WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:02.150
- [Narrator] There are
many surprising stories

00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:04.680
on the stage of world history.

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:06.993
The invention of the automobile is one.

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:10.550
And, so, our play begins.

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:13.550
(audience applause)

00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:21.960
In the 1670s, Ferdinand Verbiest

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:24.530
was a Flemish Missionary and scientist.

00:00:24.530 --> 00:00:26.160
He was sent to visit the court

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:29.040
of the Kangxi Emperor in China.

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:32.040
The emperor's court was a dangerous place.

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:34.540
When Verbiest arrived,
he was held prisoner,

00:00:34.540 --> 00:00:35.972
almost chopped to bits.

00:00:35.972 --> 00:00:39.810
But instead was forced
to compete in a series

00:00:39.810 --> 00:00:42.310
of math and astronomy contests.

00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:44.230
You know, like you do.

00:00:44.230 --> 00:00:47.590
Ultimately, Verbiest's performance
so impressed the emperor,

00:00:47.590 --> 00:00:49.460
he banished the current astronomer

00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:51.073
and gave Verbiest the job.

00:00:52.120 --> 00:00:54.450
Over the years they became friends.

00:00:54.450 --> 00:00:56.970
Verbiest tutored the emperor in geometry,

00:00:56.970 --> 00:00:58.880
philosophy and music.

00:00:58.880 --> 00:01:00.545
Around 1672,

00:01:00.545 --> 00:01:04.250
Verbiest designed, as a toy
for his friend the emperor,

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:06.190
a steam propelled trolley.

00:01:06.190 --> 00:01:09.413
It was an automobile in the truest sense.

00:01:12.490 --> 00:01:15.067
No one really knows if it got built.

00:01:15.067 --> 00:01:19.445
The drawings that Verbiest
did are all that remains.

00:01:19.445 --> 00:01:22.810
Nonetheless, those designs are most likely

00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:25.850
the earliest self-moving
machine ever conceived.

00:01:25.850 --> 00:01:29.590
Many automobiles would follow
over the years, but few were

00:01:29.590 --> 00:01:34.523
conceived as a gift to a
merciful emperor slash BFF.

